//  Register allocation: multiplicand (d = a0-a1+p, then a1) = x3..x7;
//                       acc z0..z5 = x8..x13,
//                       scalar bi = x14, MULADD temp x15;
//                       scalars streamed from [sp].
//  Stack: [sp+0 .. 40) holds s = a0+a1;
//         [sp+40 .. 80) holds t = 2*a0.
